# Fonts Directory

This directory contains custom font files for the AISSEE Preparation app.

## Recommended Font: Plus Jakarta Sans
Based on the Stitch Design System, we use **Plus Jakarta Sans** across all typography levels for its modern, friendly, and geometric proportions.

## Required Font Weights
Download from Google Fonts and place here:
- PlusJakartaSans-Regular.ttf (400)
- PlusJakartaSans-Medium.ttf (500)
- PlusJakartaSans-SemiBold.ttf (600)
- PlusJakartaSans-Bold.ttf (700)
- PlusJakartaSans-ExtraBold.ttf (800)

## Configuration
After placing font files, update your `package.json`:
```json
"expo": {
  "fonts": [
    "./src/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-Regular.ttf",
    "./src/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-Medium.ttf",
    "./src/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-SemiBold.ttf",
    "./src/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-Bold.ttf",
    "./src/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-ExtraBold.ttf"
  ]
}
```

Then load fonts in `App.tsx`:
```tsx
import * as Font from "expo-font";
await Font.loadAsync({
  PlusJakartaSans_400Regular: require("./assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-Regular.ttf"),
  PlusJakartaSans_500Medium: require("./assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-Medium.ttf"),
  // etc.
});
```
